<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ABB raised to outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ABB raised to outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brother analyst Chris Heminway said on Monday he had raised his rating for engineering company ABB AB to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The company in 1996 corrected its &quot;relative underperformance&quot; but &quot;we remain cautious on earnings outlook,&quot; Heminway wrote in an analysis.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
